[{"information_id":"2","sort_order":"1","status":"1","language_id":"1","title":"Terms &amp; Conditions","description":"&lt;p&gt;\r\n\tTerms &amp;amp; Conditions&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n","meta_title":"Terms &amp; Conditions","meta_description":"","meta_keyword":"","store_id":"0"},{"information_id":"4","sort_order":"2","status":"1","language_id":"1","title":"Delivery Information","description":"&lt;p&gt;\r\n\tDelivery Information&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n","meta_title":"Delivery Information","meta_description":"","meta_keyword":"","store_id":"0"},{"information_id":"1","sort_order":"3","status":"1","language_id":"1","title":"About Us","description":"&lt;p&gt;\r\n\tAbout Us&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n","meta_title":"About Us","meta_description":"","meta_keyword":"","store_id":"0"},{"information_id":"3","sort_order":"4","status":"1","language_id":"1","title":"Privacy Policy (Updated 2025)","description":"&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Date:&lt;\/strong&gt; 9 August 2025&lt;\/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;This &lt;strong&gt;General Privacy Policy&lt;\/strong&gt; (\u201c&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;\/strong&gt;\u201d) describes how &lt;strong&gt;Zaynjewels&lt;\/strong&gt; (\u201c&lt;strong&gt;we&lt;\/strong&gt;\u201d, \u201c&lt;strong&gt;our&lt;\/strong&gt;\u201d, \u201c&lt;strong&gt;us&lt;\/strong&gt;\u201d) collects, uses, processes, and protects your personal data in accordance with &lt;strong&gt;applicable Indian privacy laws&lt;\/strong&gt; (including the Information Technology Act, 2000 and the Information Technology [Reasonable Security Practices and Procedures and Sensitive Personal Data or Information] Rules, 2011) and, where applicable, the &lt;strong&gt;General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)&lt;\/strong&gt; of the European Union.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Privacy Policy applies to all personal data collected by Zaynjewels, including through our &lt;strong&gt;website&lt;\/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;mobile applications&lt;\/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;social media channels&lt;\/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;authorized retailers&lt;\/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;offline interactions&lt;\/strong&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;If there is any inconsistency between this Privacy Policy and a privacy policy specific to any Zaynjewels Club program, the provisions of this Privacy Policy shall prevail, unless expressly stated otherwise.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Types of Personal Data We Collect&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;The personal data we collect depends on the nature of your interaction with us and may include:&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identification Data:&lt;\/strong&gt; Name, gender, date of birth.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact Details:&lt;\/strong&gt; Address, email, phone number.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transaction Data:&lt;\/strong&gt; Order details, billing address, shipping address, payment details (credit\/debit card, UPI, bank details).&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Data:&lt;\/strong&gt; Username, password, account preferences.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demographic Information:&lt;\/strong&gt; Country, language preferences.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sensitive Personal Data:&lt;\/strong&gt; Only where necessary for transactions or legal compliance (e.g., payment details, identity verification documents).&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Data:&lt;\/strong&gt; IP address, browser type, device identifiers, geolocation data, cookies, and usage patterns.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. How We Collect Your Personal Data&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We collect data directly from you when you:&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Contact us or our authorized retailers.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Register for an account or membership (including Zaynjewels Club).&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Participate in promotions, competitions, surveys, or events.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Make a purchase, request repairs, returns, or warranties.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Submit queries via our website, mobile app, or social media channels.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Apply for a job or provide services as a supplier\/contractor.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We also collect data &lt;strong&gt;automatically&lt;\/strong&gt; through cookies, tracking technologies, and analytics tools when you interact with our website or digital platforms.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Cookies &amp;amp; Tracking Technologies&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We use cookies and similar technologies to:&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Improve website functionality and user experience.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Analyze traffic patterns and usage trends.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Remember your preferences and settings.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;You can manage or disable cookies via your browser settings, but doing so may limit site functionality.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Purposes of Use&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We process your personal data to:&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Provide, enhance, and personalize our products and services.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Process transactions and deliver orders.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Respond to customer service requests and complaints.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Manage promotions, contests, and loyalty programs.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Conduct market research and improve our offerings.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Process job applications and manage HR records.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Comply with legal and regulatory requirements.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Enforce contractual terms and protect our legal rights.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Where GDPR applies, we process personal data under one or more of the following lawful bases:&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consent&lt;\/strong&gt; \u2013 where you have given clear consent for processing.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract&lt;\/strong&gt; \u2013 processing is necessary for a contract with you.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal Obligation&lt;\/strong&gt; \u2013 processing is required by law.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legitimate Interests&lt;\/strong&gt; \u2013 processing is necessary for our legitimate business purposes (e.g., fraud prevention, improving services) without overriding your rights.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. Data Sharing &amp;amp; Disclosure&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We may share your personal data with:&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Authorized Zaynjewels retailers and service partners.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Payment gateways, logistics providers, and IT service providers.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Marketing and analytics partners (only where legally permissible).&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Legal authorities, regulators, or law enforcement where required.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We &lt;strong&gt;do not sell&lt;\/strong&gt; your personal data to third parties.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. International Data Transfers&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Where your personal data is transferred outside India or the European Economic Area (EEA), we ensure appropriate safeguards (such as Standard Contractual Clauses) are in place to protect your data.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8. Data Retention&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected, or as required by applicable law. When data is no longer needed, we securely delete or anonymize it.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9. Your Rights&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h3&gt;Under Indian Privacy Laws:&lt;\/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to access your personal data.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to request correction of inaccuracies.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to withdraw consent (subject to contractual\/legal limitations).&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h3&gt;Under GDPR (for EU\/EEA customers):&lt;\/h3&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right of Access \u2013 obtain a copy of your personal data.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to Rectification \u2013 correct inaccurate or incomplete data.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to Erasure (\u201cRight to be Forgotten\u201d).&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to Restrict Processing.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to Data Portability.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to Object to Processing (including direct marketing).&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;li&gt;\r\n\t&lt;p&gt;Right to Withdraw Consent at any time.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\t&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;You may exercise your rights by contacting us at &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:privacy@zaynjewels.com&quot;&gt;privacy@zaynjewels.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10. Data Security&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We implement &lt;strong&gt;reasonable security measures&lt;\/strong&gt; to protect personal data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction, including encryption, firewalls, and access controls.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;11. Children\u2019s Privacy&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our services are not intended for individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12. Changes to This Privacy Policy&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updates will be posted on our website with the \u201cEffective Date\u201d revised accordingly.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;hr \/&gt;\r\n&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;13. Contact Us&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, please contact:&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection Officer (DPO)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;br \/&gt;\r\n&lt;strong&gt;Zaynjewels&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;br \/&gt;\r\nEmail: &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@zaynjewels.com&quot;&gt;info@zaynjewels.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;br \/&gt;\r\nPhone: &lt;a href=&quot;tel:+19499006910&quot;&gt;+1 (949) 900-6910&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","meta_title":"Privacy Policy","meta_description":"","meta_keyword":"","store_id":"0"}]